    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Proposed test with existing data: Across a phylogenetically controlled sample, regress observed male combat intensity and weapon presence or size on mating-system polygyny. Higher combat and weapon prevalence in polygynous species support the claim; no association or stronger effects in monogamous species refute it.";
